    "answer": "Context engineering is about curating the optimal set of tokens in the model's window at inference time, rather than writing instructions. The term was popularised in June 2025 when Shopify's CEO Tobi Lütke preferred it to \"prompt engineering\", followed by Andrej Karpathy and Simon Willison, and later Gartner and Anthropic."
